      "type": "featured-text",
      "name": "Rich text and image",
      "settings": {
        "title": "",
        "content": "<p>Yoga Jeevan programs can also align beautifully with your <strong>CSR goals</strong>. Through partnerships with <strong>artisan collectives supported by YogaKargha</strong>, companies can combine wellness initiatives with social impact.</p><p>For instance, each wellness program can contribute towards:</p><ul><li>Funding artisan training and fair-wage weaving projects in rural India.</li><li>Sponsoring handcrafted mats or meditation aids made by local women weavers.</li><li>Supporting sustainable livelihoods as part of holistic employee-wellness efforts.</li></ul><p>In this way, wellness becomes circular — nurturing your teams while uplifting communities.</p>",
